{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はMJ収録でしたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/04/7202869/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新衣装着て新曲歌ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装は今までと違った感じです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリティです。むふふふふん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/04/7202869/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏と若"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/04/7202869/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月の表情ツボです。はい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだそうだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、髪を3rdくらいの長さに戻そうと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張っておるのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいぶ伸びてきたよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーいわーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/04/7202869/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/04/7202869/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/04/7202869/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/04/7202869/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/04/7202869/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/04/7202869/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/04/7202869/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またポストカード買っちゃった、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な絵を見ちゃうと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つい手が伸びてしまう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋にぺたぺた貼るか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、欲しかった本を手に入れた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/04/7202869/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵だ。刺激的だ。大事にする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は乃木どこ収録"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/04/7202869/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/04/7202869/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}